# Mutation plan for `FileWillBeUploaded` (`runPluginsHook`) on the simple upload and on the
# completing chunk of a resumable one, and the host client's merge (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 5).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-hooks-uploads.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_upload_hook_fires_as_go_fires_it`.
#
# Not mutated: the `file_upload_rejected` event (the tour holds no websocket), the move-failure
# 500 (unreachable on a working disk), several plugins sharing one reader and one writer (the
# tour has one plugin), and a plugin moving `Path` (the recorder never does). The last two lines
# are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

